	<code>'UKA'</code>
	<data_rate>1000</data_rate>
	<description>'Unimanual Kinarm Approach Avoid Task. Blocks must be grouped into 24 trials and only the first 12 or last 12 must be run within each block. The first 12 trials must be the condition to assess (i.e. physical activity vs sedentary behaviour approach-avoidance bias). The first 6 trials of these 12 must be images of one condition and the next 6 must be images of the other condition. The next 12 trials (13-24) must be neutral stimuli. The first 6 must be one neutral image type and the next 6 must be another neutral image type (i.e. first 6 = circles, next 6 = squares).'</description>
